>**{c=red:Notes:}**
* You can only have one Escort for Hire quest active at any time.
* Escort for Hire quests can be deactivated by returning to the NPC that began the quest.
* Only one Escort for Hire quest can be completed each Conquest Tally.
* Can summon trusts.
* Zoning in with an {p:Adventuring Fellow} despawns the Escort NPC.

=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Dehn Harzhapan} to begin the quest.
* Head to {z:Garlaige Citadel}.
* As soon as you zone in you will receive a cutscene.
* Once the cutscene is over, an NPC named {n:Wanzo-Unzozo} will spawn.
** Speaking to {n:Wanzo-Unzozo} will make him stop running. Talking to him again will make him continue. He will aggro almost everything in the zone.
** Pay attention to {n:Wanzo-Unzozo} {p:HP}, if it gets too low he will aggro any undead inside. He can be {p:cured|Cure} to prevent this.
** Just like monsters, {n:Wanzo-Unzozo} can run through the **Banishing Gate** so be sure to stop him before you open it, or have the {k:Pouch of weighted stones}.
* You will have 30 minutes to complete this quest.
* Escort {n:Wanzo-Unzozo} until he stops on his own. Quickly talk to him to receive {k:Completion certificate} ({p:Key Item}).
** If he vanishes before you talk to him you will not get the key item and you will have to do this quest over again.
* Return to {n:Dehn Harzhapan} for your reward.

